<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - I2 Tech raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - I2 Tech raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs confirmed it added i2 Technologies Inc to recommended list, raising it from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- shares jumped 2-3/8 to 43-3/4.</p>
